~ start
Farai: Nice to put a name to a face, Cupid. Thank you for meeting me early.
Cupid: Greetings, Royal Farai. Here are the materials, and you're welcome.

$> dialogue.start_item_requests()

if dialogue.all_correct_items():
	$> dialogue.record_tier_result(2)
	=> player_choice
elif dialogue.wrong_specific_item():
	$> dialogue.record_tier_result(1)
	Farai: Thank you, I will take my leave now. May we meet again. 
elif dialogue.wrong_item_type():
	$> dialogue.record_tier_result(0)
	Farai: Well, this certainly isn’t right. I will remember this the next time we meet.

=> END

~ player_choice
- A fountain pen should be used to make the writing more sophisticated.
	Cupid: A fountain pen should be used to make the writing more sophisticated.
- Acquire a quill and some ink to embody the past times.
	Cupid: Acquire a quill and some ink to embody the past times.
- A ballpoint pen’s ink will dry fast enough to prevent smudging.
	$> dialogue.increase_tier_for_correct_choice()
	Cupid: A ballpoint pen’s ink will dry fast enough to prevent smudging.
Farai: Ah, thank you for your advice. I will take my leave now. May we meet again. 